## MCP auth (Cursor agents)

- **Magnific app:** https://www.magnific.com/app — Steve login, credits, home **Connect** for AI agents
- Server: **`user-Magnific`** · OAuth — **no API key** in chat
- Reauth: Cursor → Settings → MCP → Magnific → Disconnect / Connect → Reload Window → `library_list` verify
- Read tool schema under `mcps/user-Magnific/tools/` before every call

## Upload flow (mandatory for refs — Kojo parity)

Local PNGs are **not** visible to Magnific cloud. Never pass `http://127.0.0.1/...` refs.

```
creations_request_upload (mimeType: image/png)
  → PUT bytes to presigned URL
  → creations_finalize_upload
  → identifier for references[]
```

Or `creations_upload_image` when you have a stable public URL.

## `images_generate` (per-case portrait)

| Param | Value |
|-------|--------|
| `mode` | `imagen-nano-banana-2` (MCP slug) or `auto` |
| `aspectRatio` | `16:9` |
| `resolution` | **`2k`** (never omit) |
| `count` | `2` for A/B pick |

**`references[]` order (never text-only):**

1. **`image`** — crop lock / baseplate  
   - Male: `dev/anatomic-plates/raw/male-ed-anatomic-plate-a.png`  
   - Female layout: `public/assets/patient/patient-scene-female.png`
2. **`image`** (optional) — anatomy scope `*-anatomic-plate-anatomy.png` — **adult gens only; never pediatric** (NSFW filter)
3. **`character`** — lady map from `patientLadyRefs.json` when female case
4. Prompt: `server/casePortrait.js` `buildPortraitPrompt()` + `dev/scene-camera-lock/prompts/magnific-camera-lock.txt`

Then: **`creations_wait`** → download → `fitToBaseplate` (1536×864) → `.case-portraits/case_XXX.png` + `.json` meta `provider: magnific`.

## Play runtime (learner Regenerate button)

| Auth | Path |
|------|------|
| **MCP (agents)** | Batch regen in Cursor — preferred when no REST key |
| **`MAGNIFIC_API_KEY`** | `server/magnificImage.js` REST — Business plan only |
| **HF** | Server fallback if Magnific REST fails and `HF` token available |

REST uses **inline base64** refs (not localhost URLs). If REST unavailable, agent runs MCP batch above.

